WEBVTT

00:23:26.788 --> 00:23:31.871
professional life so much that in my
personal life I'm like to my husband,

00:23:32.246 --> 00:23:35.371
can you please just can you decide what
we're going to have for dinner?

00:23:36.163 --> 00:23:38.746
You decide I'm fine with whatever.

00:23:39.204 --> 00:23:42.871
In other parts of Google and Alphabet,
escalation has been a problem.

00:23:43.621 --> 00:23:47.454
They took eight years to abandon their
failed attempt at social networking.

00:23:47.913 --> 00:23:52.579
Remember Google Plus? And they waited too
long to recognize that Google Glass

00:23:52.579 --> 00:23:54.788
was not going to make it
as a consumer product.

00:23:55.246 --> 00:23:58.996
So it xts rapid evaluators like Cathy
were tasked with offering

00:23:58.996 --> 00:24:03.413
an outside perspective on bold ideas,
looking for reasons to pull the plug,